# runtime scratch for local dev/test runs (dev-server logs, pids, throwaway BRAINBOOK_HOME copies
# of the real app home). Lives inside the repo so a run never has to write outside the workspace —
# that is what killed the first attempt at this card: its log went to /tmp, the command was refused,
# and the whole verification never ran.
.run/
